WEBVTT

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:04.960
What an incredible display!

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:10.590
I'd witnessed the Saint's mere presence
reducing an area's monster population,

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:15.800
but to completely eradicate an entire
swarm of them in mere instants?!

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.890
And you also dissipated the miasma
from whence they spawned!

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:22.520
Breathtaking, outstanding use of magic,

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:25.310
one quite deserving of being
labeled as true purification magic!

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:29.400
Slow down.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:34.450
We must explore it deeper, much deeper!

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:37.160
Oh, uh, sure, but...

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:42.160
Fret not. Sacrifices must sometimes be
made to advance the science of magic.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.750
Grand Magus Drewes, might I suggest you
withhold from joking about this matter?

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:50.670
My apologies, I couldn't help myself.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:56.720
Thank you for all you've done today.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:01.850
Had you not been with us, all of us
would have likely perished.

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:04.690
I-I wish I'd done it on purpose!
It just happened, that's all.

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:14.190
These powers of yours must
weigh heavily upon you.

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:16.030
But no matter what may come,

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:17.410
you will still be <i>you</i>.

00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:22.290
Th-Thank you.

00:02:56.670 --> 00:03:01.550
The Commander's right. I'll always be me.

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:02.660
Look! It's Her Holiness, the Saint!

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:04.390
That's her?

00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:05.200
Did you hear what she did?

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.930
Yes, on that expedition?

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:12.520
I wish I could still believe that,
like I did before.

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:15.940
Saint

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:21.570
What's got you so lost in thought?

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:26.200
Everyone's been acting strange
around me as of late.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:29.620
Makes sense, considering the talk of the
Saint's conjury going around the Palace.

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:35.340
I'm sure you'll get used
to it sooner or later.

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:38.300
I don't <i>want </i>to get used to it.

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:42.510
Sorry.

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:47.680
I wish I had the power to
grant you your every desire.

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:49.350
Ser Director...

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:53.350
But your life is only going to get
more complicated from here on out.

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:58.820
So I probably won't be able to keep
living here for much longer, huh?

00:03:58.820 --> 00:04:03.110
Not if you're going to join the Knights
on expeditions far from the capital.

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:04.620
You mean the countryside?

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:11.790
The capital is hardly the only place
threatened by monstrous hordes.

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:17.040
Towns and cities from all around have
petitioned for the Knights' assistance.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:18.420
What's wrong?

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:23.760
Maybe I <i>should </i>just transfer to the
Royal Magi Assembly after all.

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:27.430
I don't see why you should.

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:28.350
Huh?

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:32.520
The countryside is teeming with
unique herbs and potion recipes.

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:35.480
If we treat your extended tour
as an opportunity to study them,

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:39.610
then I see no reason why you
couldn't stay with the Institute.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:41.280
Are you sure?

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:44.400
I just said you could, didn't I?
Don't worry about it.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:00.880
This is absolutely not happening today.

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:03.800
Is casting the Saint's conjury difficult?

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:07.680
I don't even know what I did <i>to </i>cast it.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:12.520
I'm terribly sorry. If only I'd been
watching you when you cast...

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:15.770
O-Oh, please, there's no reason
for <i>you </i>to apologize, Ser Drewes--

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:19.690
I deeply regret that I missed the
opportunity to verify your conjury.

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:22.900
Had I observed it more carefully,
this would not be happening.

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:26.660
Which means, "you could be
casting it willy-nilly for me."

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:28.950
Let's end our lesson here for today.

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:38.170
Why did you decide to have
our lesson at the palace today?

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:40.250
I thought a change of scenery might--

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:41.460
Persistent woman!

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:44.590
I'm sorry, Your Highness,

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:47.550
but continuing on as you have
will be to her detriment.

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:49.260
Please, reconsider your approach.

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:50.760
Is that Liz?

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:51.930
Elizabeth,

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:54.890
you claim to care about Aira's well-being,
but this isn't about her, is it?

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:56.730
What is that supposed to mean,
Your Highness?

00:05:56.730 --> 00:06:01.860
I know you've been trying to get
Aira away from me at all costs.

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:05.280
Whatever are you talking about?

00:06:08.070 --> 00:06:09.030
Aira!

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:15.250
It's obvious you're only attempting
to isolate her because you're jealous.

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:16.250
<i>Jealous</i>?

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:22.210
You <i>are </i>my fiancée, after all.

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:25.340
I'm sure you dislike her constant
presence by my side.

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:34.930
If you believe that is a concern,
then why not agree to my proposal?

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:37.850
I'm sure you <i>all </i>understand
how ungentlemanly it is

00:06:37.850 --> 00:06:41.690
for a betrothed man to devote the
majority of his time to another woman.

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:45.820
I supervised the Saint Summoning Ritual.
As such, I am responsible for Aira.

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:50.610
As the one who summoned her without
warning, I must protect her from harm.

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:54.660
I have no qualms about my behavior,
nor should I.

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:58.830
Yet Aira was not the only
woman you summoned.

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:02.540
You do not seem to be taking
responsibility of any sort for <i>her</i>.

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:05.460
Ah, yes, the subject of those many rumors.

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:07.170
She is most certainly <i>not </i>the Saint.

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:08.720
Excuse me?

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:12.720
Our people want to see their
Saint joining expeditions,

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:17.980
so they sent <i>someone </i>on one to
appease the masses, I presume.

00:07:17.980 --> 00:07:23.900
Your Highness, are you even aware of the
words that just came out of your mouth?

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:24.940
Oh, she's mad!

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:37.040
Sei!

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:39.790
Uhh, good afternoon.

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:43.500
This isn't good.

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:45.960
What should I say, Ser--

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:48.420
He's gone! What?! Why?!

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:49.920
Wait, is that...

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:52.430
I can't believe she's here!

00:07:52.430 --> 00:07:53.970
It's her, all right!

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:55.220
It has to be her...

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:58.390
Who are you?

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:04.400
My name is Sei.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:05.400
Ah, <i>you</i>.

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:11.360
Pardon me, Liz, but if you two would
like to continue your discussion,

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:13.700
perhaps you could do so in private?

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:15.200
I don't think this is
the right place for it...

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:16.200
Silence!

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:27.460
Commander Hawke!

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:28.920
What is all this ruckus about?

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:36.890
Father!

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:41.100
I'm appalled that you would allow your
foolishness to cause such a scene.

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:46.860
Not only that, but you've
insulted the Saint.

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:57.660
I've done no such thing.
<i>They </i>were the ones who insulted <i>me</i>.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:09:03.830
Oh? Did I not just hear you accuse
the Saint of being an impostor?

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:09.130
Is it not true that she's an impostor--
one you prepared yourself, Father?

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:11.300
What lead you to believe this?

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:14.630
Aira was the only one
summoned during the--

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:18.470
Untrue. Lady Sei was <i>also </i>summoned.

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:24.810
I could have forgiven you this
oversight in the moment,

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:29.150
but since then, countless reports have
stated that <i>two </i>women were summoned.

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:31.860
For you to still be ignorant
to that fact is inexcusable.

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:32.940
But Father--

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:35.650
And Grand Magus Drewes'
appraisals have concluded

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:39.870
that Lady Sei is unmistakably the Saint.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:41.240
Wait, really?

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:46.710
Others agree as well.

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:49.840
In Commander Hawke's report on
the Knights' most recent expedition,

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:54.630
he declares that Lady Sei brilliantly
fulfilled her Saintly duties.

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:59.010
This was, of course, verified by other
reports made by Second Order Knights.

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:05.600
I know that you feel responsible for the
ritual and wish to keep Lady Aira safe.

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:08.980
But do you not see how you've failed
to do the same for Lady Sei,

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:11.400
and in your negligence,
labeled her an impostor?

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:14.070
After all Lady Sei has achieved,

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:17.240
everyone acknowledges
her as the true Saint.

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:21.240
Yet what has Lady Aira achieved?

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:26.540
Lady Aira has not yet achieved anything
warranting of a formal statement.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:30.170
And yet, you still insisted that
Lady Sei was an impostor?

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:33.920
You've no grounds for such a conclusion.

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:38.090
Let us continue this discussion elsewhere.

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:42.800
Might I ask you to join us in
that discussion, Lady Ashley?

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:44.560
As you wish, Your Majesty.

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:49.230
As for you, Lady Sei,
I shall speak with you later.

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:50.690
Y-Yes, Your Majesty.

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:55.980
U-Umm--

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:56.990
Lady Aira.

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:15.130
I believe I understand now.

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:17.630
Is there anything else I ought to know?

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:21.300
No, Father. The fault lies
squarely upon my shoulders.

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:23.970
I am prepared to accept
responsibility for my actions

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:26.640
and whatever punishment you may see fit.

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:31.400
But I would ask you to
promise me one thing.

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:32.810
Go on.

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:37.280
Aira Misono is <i>not </i>the Saint.
This we now know.

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:40.110
She was only considered to be
the Saint because I insisted she was.

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:43.570
As such, I would ask that she
be granted the freedom

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:46.660
to live her life as she so wishes.

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:51.580
Very well. I swear to respect and
protect her freedom and agency.

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:54.000
Thank you, Father.

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:57.170
As for the appropriate punishment,

00:11:57.170 --> 00:12:02.010
Kyle Salutania and his companions
are to be placed under house arrest.

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:03.840
Very well.

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:09.310
Second Prince Rayne is to be entrusted
with Aira's care and monitoring.

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:13.310
I would like to assist him in
that regard, Lady Ashley.

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:15.560
If you are willing, that is.

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:17.070
Of course, Your Majesty.

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:20.650
That will be all.

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:26.620
You planned for this to happen
all along, didn't you?

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:30.330
Whatever are you talking about?

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:40.050
No matter what happened, Lady Aira would
always have been labeled an impostor.

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:46.260
But by embroiling her in your foolish
antics, she instead emerges as a victim.

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:49.600
Now, no one will openly disparage her.

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:52.940
Your purposefully crude behavior

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:55.440
will lessen any criticism
directed towards her.

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:57.310
You give me too much credit.

00:12:57.310 --> 00:13:01.150
I'm nothing but a selfish,
mistaken prince.

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:04.780
Is that so? Then I shall
remember that henceforth.

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:06.160
Liz.

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:09.870
You haven't called me that in a long time.

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:11.200
Please take care of Aira.

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:18.340
You needn't even ask.

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:28.100
If only he weren't so awkward.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:34.810
To think my son would take such
a foolish course of action.

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:37.480
Though his honesty is one of his virtues.

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:42.690
He reminds me of you when you
were younger, Your Majesty.

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:44.820
Please, don't remind me.

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:03.840
Good day to you, Sei!

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:05.630
Good day to <i>you</i>, Liz.

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:06.970
And...

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:09.890
I suppose we should start with
a proper introduction, huh.

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:14.810
N-Nice to meet you, I'm Misono Aira.

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:17.520
It's nice to meet you, too.
I'm Takanashi Sei.

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:29.820
I gotta say something...

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:32.280
What's something a younger girl
might be interested in?

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:39.920
T'would seem you've been
officially canonized as the Saint.

00:14:41.630 --> 00:14:42.880
Can we change the subject?

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:47.340
What will you do about your work?

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:49.130
Sounds like I can stay with the Institute.

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:51.930
Oh, that's wonderful!

00:14:51.930 --> 00:14:55.930
I was just thinking about how I'd <i>love</i>
to hear more about your work.

00:14:55.930 --> 00:14:57.350
Wouldn't you?

00:14:57.350 --> 00:15:02.230
Yes, uh, have you been working at the
palace this whole time, Takanashi-<i>san</i>?

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:07.070
Yes, I've been studying potion-making at
the Medicinal Flora Research Institute.

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:13.160
I don't know what I'll do now.

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:19.370
I wish it didn't have to change,
but I haven't really <i>done </i>anything...

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:22.840
Is there anything you'd like to
do in particular, Misono-<i>san</i>?

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:24.800
I don't know...

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:28.590
If I could, I'd like to
keep studying magic.

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:35.850
Well then, why not join up with
the Royal Magi Assembly?

00:15:35.850 --> 00:15:38.230
That's a wonderful idea!

00:15:38.230 --> 00:15:40.770
You're quite the talented mage, Aira.

00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:44.270
Why, mages with your abilities come
only once every century or so!

00:15:44.270 --> 00:15:46.190
L-Liz!

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:48.610
You're embarrassing me...

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:52.070
That's all the more reason for you
to join the Royal Magi Assembly!

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:55.120
B-But do you really think they'll take me?

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:57.370
Absolutely, without a doubt!

00:15:57.370 --> 00:16:00.460
On top of all that talent,
you're an extremely hard worker!

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:07.170
And if you joined the Assembly,
I'd get to see you more often.

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:13.260
I'm there quite often to take
lessons from the Grand Magus.

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:15.720
Perhaps we'd even get to learn together.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:18.850
Then, before I left, we could have tea
or spend some time together.

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:20.890
Y-Yes, I'd like that!

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:23.600
My, leaving me out, are you?

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:25.650
You could join the Assembly too, Liz.

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:28.480
How cruel of you to suggest I <i>could</i>, Sei.

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:32.530
W-Well, you could join us for tea, Liz.

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:36.780
After all, you're the very first
friend I made over here.

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:38.740
Oh, Aira!

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:49.960
The countryside is as
fraught as ever, then?

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:50.920
Indeed.

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:53.550
While things near the capital have calmed,

00:16:53.550 --> 00:16:55.390
we receive more petitions
for aid every day.

00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:57.600
Now that the previous dispute
has been resolved,

00:16:57.600 --> 00:17:01.640
all have come to recognize
Lady Sei as the Saint.

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:04.650
I'm sure the noble lords
are all abuzz about it.

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:06.810
With the Saint truly in our midst,

00:17:06.810 --> 00:17:10.190
regions near and far are
calling for her assistance.

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:15.820
The region most in need of assistance
is likely Klausner's Domain.

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:20.240
Indeed, given it is the Kingdom's largest
producer of medicinal herbs.

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:22.910
Not only have they been hard-hit
by the miasma's monsters,

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:25.830
but their herb production has
decreased dramatically as well.

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:38.760
Are you making <i>more </i>potions <i>again</i>, Sei?
You're making me worried.

00:17:38.760 --> 00:17:40.970
Oh, I'm fine!

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:44.690
I mean, I'm not worried about <i>you</i>.

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:47.060
We're about to run out of herbs is all.

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:52.940
Oh, right, our stores are running low.

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:57.570
Yeah, what with the import restrictions
on herbs out of Klausner's Domain.

00:17:57.570 --> 00:18:00.120
Clausna's... what?

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:02.160
It's where most of our herbs are grown.

00:18:02.160 --> 00:18:05.870
It's also called the
"Alchemist's Holy Land."

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:08.420
Wow, I had no idea.

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:11.880
Sei, could you bring some
tea up to my office?

00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:12.960
Yes, ser.

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:15.220
Get him something he might like, yeah?

00:18:22.350 --> 00:18:24.020
Sorry that took so long.

00:18:26.350 --> 00:18:28.270
Come, drink with us.

00:18:28.270 --> 00:18:30.980
Didn't you have important
matters to discuss?

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:32.520
We're all done with that.

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:50.250
I started staring at him again...

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:55.090
So, uh, don't forget about
little old me, you two.

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:59.680
Wh-What was it you needed
to talk about today?

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:03.470
Al's going to be away from the
capital on a mission for a while.

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:07.100
The monster presence near the
capital has lessened, after all.

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:09.560
I'll be headed out into the
countryside from here on out.

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:11.810
Do you know where you're going first?

00:19:11.810 --> 00:19:13.860
Klausner's Domain.

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:15.610
Where the herbs are grown?

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:16.570
That's right.

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:20.320
The palace must want to address
our problematic herb shortage.

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:22.700
That makes sense.

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:26.160
When are you going to be leaving?

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:29.160
In just about two weeks from today.

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:30.210
All right.

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:34.210
I'll make sure I'm ready by then.

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:35.500
Ready for what?

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:36.510
Huh?

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:39.470
Why do <i>you </i>need to get
ready for his departure?

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:41.430
Do you need to prepare
some potions or something?

00:19:41.430 --> 00:19:45.600
Well, yes, but I'll also need to
bring clothes, among other things.

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:47.430
<i>Clothes</i>?

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:49.980
Wait, are you planning on joining them?

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:53.270
Well, yes, didn't we talk
about that before?

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:55.570
I suppose that did come up...

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:57.480
Though you sure are raring to go.

00:19:57.480 --> 00:20:04.870
Well, Klausner's Domain is
"the Alchemist's Holy Land," right?

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:07.790
So, you know...

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:09.200
I understand.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:13.000
You'd like to travel to Klausner's Domain
to learn more about herbs.

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:19.920
True, there's a veritable treasure trove
of herbology knowledge out there,

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:22.510
some of which we lack here in the capital.

00:20:22.510 --> 00:20:24.640
Perhaps you can bring some back to us.

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:28.470
The Knights would be stationed
there for some time, too.

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:29.980
Does that mean I can go?!

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:35.480
Actually, I'd like to ask you to join us.

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:40.190
The palace has already requested
your presence, as a matter of fact.

00:20:40.190 --> 00:20:42.530
Wait, really?

00:20:42.530 --> 00:20:45.320
Yes, but we were initially
opposed to the idea.

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:48.080
We were just discussing
how to turn them down.

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:51.290
Our travels would not be without danger,

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:54.420
and your safety is paramount, Sei.

00:20:56.420 --> 00:21:00.880
That, and if you're unsuccessful,
the nobles will have harsh words for you.

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:02.930
O-Oh.

00:21:02.930 --> 00:21:07.930
That, and you're not too fond of people
making a fuss about you, right?

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:08.930
Huh?

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:14.190
I'm sorry for causing you so much trouble.

00:21:14.190 --> 00:21:16.810
Oh, no. We should apologize for
asking you for so many favors.

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:20.030
That's right. Don't worry about it.

00:21:20.030 --> 00:21:22.030
What's Klausner's Domain known for?

00:21:22.030 --> 00:21:24.860
Thinking back, ever since I came
to work at the Institute,

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:28.530
I haven't had very many poor
experiences at the palace.

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:33.210
And I think that's because they've
been protecting me like this,

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:37.000
behind the scenes, without me knowing...

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:39.170
Thank you for all you do.

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:41.460
Huh? For what?

00:21:41.460 --> 00:21:43.800
Oh, never mind.

00:23:23.150 --> 00:23:25.280
Sei, you can see the city now.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Next Time

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Diary
